** 2567. Minimum Score by Changing Two Elements **

# Approach 1:
class Solution:
    def minimizeSum(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:
        nums.sort()
        return min(
            nums[-1] - nums[2],
            nums[-2] - nums[1],
            nums[-3] - nums[0]
        )

